S(G1,'pm-doc','Doc','A project doc with comments in the margin.',()=>K.shell('pm','Docs',{title:'Onboarding 2.0 — spec',sub:'Edited 2h ago',actions:`${H.avs(3,'xs')}${H.btn('Share','primary sm','link')}`,body:K.cols('1fr 260px',[`<div class="md" style="max-width:68ch;font-size:15px"><div class="t-h1" style="margin-bottom:12px">Onboarding 2.0</div><p>New teams take three days to see value. We want them to send their first workflow in under an hour.</p><h4>Problem</h4><p>Setup asks for too much before showing anything useful. <mark style="background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--fg);border-radius:4px;padding:0 3px">62% drop at the import step.</mark></p><h4>Proposal</h4><ul><li>Start from a template with sample data.</li><li>Import later, from any screen.</li><li>Invite teammates after the first win.</li></ul><h4>Success</h4><p>Time to first workflow under 60 minutes for 70% of new teams.</p></div>`,`<div class="vstack" style="gap:10px"><div class="t-label">Comments · 3</div>${[[pp[2],'Can we cite the source of the 62%?','1h'],[pp[4],'Template gallery needs 3 options max.','3h'],[pp[1],'Agree on inviting later.','5h']].map(c=>`<div class="card pad vstack" style="gap:6px;padding:12px"><div class="row">${K.av(c[0],'xs')}<b class="grow" style="font-size:13px">${c[0].first}</b><time class="t-small">${c[2]}</time></div><span style="font-size:13px">${c[1]}</span></div>`).join('')}</div>`])}),'markdown,card');
